id: ART5-4
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: artifact_view_binding_contract
target: crates/web/src/artifact_view.rs
find:             ViewKind::CardList => "view_card_list",
replace:             ViewKind::CardList => "view_card_lizt",
expect: compile-fail
expect-compile-error: ViewKind::list_field must equal "view_" + as_str()
note: list_field の直書きを語彙の綴りからずらす（const の表明でコンパイルが止まる。#2039）
